Z||000007||BBBAD GT||08-08-2000||02:22 PM||||I hear you mrfixit58, what I was saying about the single plane intake was that it seems a little 'out of place' on the stock longblock and 600 carb.  I was thinking a performer/RPM (dual plane)would be a better option for the motor.  <P>The gearing with the 5 speed mainly determines where in the RPM ban the motor will most likely be.  I'll be above 2k about 98% of the time, just where this particular intake comes in per Chris. <P>I agree about the sizing of the carb, you can go backwards from putting on a bigger/smaller carb than needed.<P>I guess I'll just have to see where it stands initally and go from there.  <P>No guesses yet?   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>||||reg||1
