Z||000026||BBBAD GT||08-11-2000||09:14 AM||||The only way a V6 is going to run with the LS1's is to have forced induction of some kind, taking the driver error out of the equation.  Those LS1's pull 300 rwhp easily bone stock at 3600lb, a 2900lb Fiero would have to put out approx 240 rwhp just to match it (taking driver error out).  Thats asking alot out of a six banger without some type of forced induction.  <P><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/BBBAD_GT_SIG.gif">  <P><A HREF="http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/Fiero.htm" TARGET=_blank>BBBAD GT</A><BR><A HREF="http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/" TARGET=_blank>BBBAD 5.0</A>||||reg||1
